SESSION_*.md
BUG_HUNT_*.md
# Dated release-prep runbooks (RELEASE_<yyyy-mm-dd>.md). The `20` keeps this from
# swallowing a RELEASE_NOTES.md, which would belong in the repo.
RELEASE_20*.md

